Josie and the Pussycats is a 2001 musical comedy film co-produced by
Universal Pictures and Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Pictures.

13
01:00:40,000 --> 01:00:46,000
Written and directed by Harry Elfont and Deborah Kaplan, the film is based on both the
Archie Comics series and the Hanna-Barbera cartoon of the same name.

14
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
Filmed entirely in Vancouver, Canada, the film features Rachael Leigh Cook, Tara Reid, and Rosario Dawson as the
Pussycats, with Alan Cumming, Parker Posey, Gabriel Mann, Paulo Costanzo, and Missi Pyle in supporting roles.

15
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
